+# T-3950 Single, double and more in the tools (track rework stage 2b)
+
+Agent trackpick, 2026-11-21, tree `.tw-trees/trackpick` (branch tw/trackpick from tw/track 833bb1ca), Vite 6168.
+Design: notes/T-3444-design/03-tools.md "Three cases" and "One rule all tools share", 10-build-plan.md row 2b.
+Advisor consulted once, before settling the rule: keep the rule on the main thread (hover and click need a
+synchronous answer; the sim function is 3e's), shape it as (edge under pointer, point, ask), second click by set
+equality with no stored state, memoise bundle members per world state, keep the Delete tool on the double, and watch
+the pick-collapsing effect, the Delete key, the line cycle in `pick.ts` and `onlyOneKind` on mixed built/blueprint.
+All taken.
+
+## What changed
+
+- **The shared rule**, `app/src/map/trackPick.ts`: `tracksAt(edge, at, ask)`; "whole" is the edge plus, for each
+  other slot of its bundle (rows' `bundle`/`slot`, T-3949), the piece nearest the point (the pointer projected onto
+  the clicked piece; its middle without a pointer) within 15 ground m, the sim's `LEVEL_WITH_M`; "piece" is the
+  edge. `pickAt` keeps only pieces built as the clicked one (a pick holds one kind, T-829, so the clicked piece always
+  stays). `clickTracks` is the click: whole, or the piece when the pick already is that whole (more than one piece);
+  `narrowsAt` asks the same for `pick.ts`; `pairedIn` gives the picked doubles held as 4 tracks (no geometry).
+  Bundle members and ids are cached per world state.
+- **Who asks it**: plain selecting (`selectAt` in main.ts sets the pick before the selection; the selection effect in
+  `blueprintPick.ts` keeps a whole pick and picks track opened from elsewhere whole at its middle), the Select tool
+  (`blueprintBox.ts`: click, Shift+click, a finger's tap, double click takes the runs of all tracks there), the line
+  cycle (`pick.ts` through its `narrows` callback: on track under a line the repeat clicks go line, 4 tracks, the
+  double, line; not played, as the check's track had no line), the track hover's
