+fdaf5bc2 (3f) before the final checks; the uncommitted work popped back with no conflict), Vite 6107. Design:
+notes/T-3444-design/04-stops.md ("Smart allocation"), 05-sim.md section 8, 10-build-plan.md row 4a2, her decision 3
+(answers-2026-11-21.md). Advisor consulted once before any edit (it set the shape below: keep `way_stops` and turn its
+two `way_station` calls into a lookup of a stored pick; picks keyed by station; old saves by the old rule at load;
+an explicit "stored, none" code in the save; shift-click on a one-way station) and once before handing back.
