+# T-4033 Paths name tracks (track rework stage c)
+
+Agent trackmodel, 2026-11-22, tree `.tw-trees/trackpaths` (branch tw/trackpaths from tw/track ef85f659, moved onto
+b3529ede (stage b) after the first phase, five conflicts, all on the run side, kept as stage b wrote them with the
+packed entries fed in; then onto 2725ad35 (4c) before the final checks, one doc conflict and one new raw site in
