+  each such piece's per-slot ways to the app (`ClockEdge.ways`, compared in the row cache, kept on `TrackEdge`).
+  `stateRows` keeps those doubles' offsets; `trackPoints` draws them `apart` (first track + `more`), so `trackLane`,
